  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masam Project to clear Yemeni lands of mines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clearing Yemeni lands of landmines and unexploded ordnance that have claimed the lives of thousands of children, women, and the elderly, thereby establishing security in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clearing Yemeni lands of landmines and unexploded ordnance. 2. Training Yemeni national personnel in mine clearance. 3. Establishing a mechanism to help Yemenis acquire sustainable mine clearance expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
